    "updated_at": "2020-10-12T20:01:29Z",
    "body": "It seems like a good idea to update the spec to allow what implementations do in practice. I'm not an expert on our timer code  and from a quick scan, I can't tell if it would violate the ordering guarantees, but the code definitely does track and care about nesting level of non-repeating timers. Besides @rniwa it's possible @cdumez would know what's up here.",
